wg-store-category-operations = Operations
wg-operation-announcer = Sector Traffic Control

wg-operation-location-space = near ({$x}, {$y})
wg-operation-location-planet = on {$world} near ({$x}, {$y})

wg-operation-inbound = {$faction} has called in an operation: the {$site} arrives {$location} in {$minutes} minutes.
wg-operation-arrived = The {$site} has arrived {$location}. It leaves in {$minutes} minutes.
wg-operation-arrived-pve = The {$site} has arrived {$location}. It leaves in {$minutes} minutes. It is a ceasefire zone for {$faction}'s operation: other crews stay clear.
wg-operation-cleared = {$faction} has cleared the {$site} {$location}.
wg-operation-failed = {$faction} failed to clear the {$site} {$location} in time. It is gone, with whatever was left on it.
wg-operation-scrubbed = The {$site} {$location} found nowhere to set down and was called off. {$faction} has its stake back.
wg-operation-ended = The {$site} {$location} is gone, with whatever was left on it.

wg-operation-site-left = Abandoned operation site

wg-operation-name-vault-transfer = Solarian Vault Transfer
wg-operation-desc-vault-transfer = Call a Solarian data vault into the sector. Haul its server home to the Halcyon for 250. The PDV is told where it is and gets the same 250 if they take it to Helios. PvP.
wg-operation-name-arms-drop = Dynasty Arms Drop
wg-operation-desc-arms-drop = Call a Phaethon weapons cache into the sector. Haul its three arms crates home to Helios for 80 each. The TSF is told where it is and gets the same if they seize them to the Halcyon. PvP.
wg-operation-name-dead-drop = Dead Drop
wg-operation-desc-dead-drop = An agent leaves a courier case at a quiet site, in space or on a world. Bring it home for 35. Only your faction is told where it is, but anyone who finds the case can cash it in. Routine risk.
wg-operation-name-salvage = Salvage Recovery
wg-operation-desc-salvage = Call in an asteroid with salvage and the wildlife on it. Clearing the wildlife doubles the stake. If it leaves first, half the stake is refunded. Only your faction is told where it is. Routine risk.
wg-operation-name-supply-drop = Supply Drop Recovery
wg-operation-desc-supply-drop = Recover supplies from a wreck held by mercenaries, adrift or crashed on a world. Clearing them returns two and a half times the stake and a supply crate. If the wreck leaves first, half the stake is refunded. Hazard risk.
wg-operation-name-convoy-raid = Convoy Raid
wg-operation-desc-convoy-raid = Hit a convoy stop held by an armed escort. Clearing them returns two and a half times the stake and a supply crate. If it leaves first, half the stake is refunded. Hazard risk.
wg-operation-name-bandit-den = Bandit Den
wg-operation-desc-bandit-den = Clear out a bandit hideout on one of the sector's worlds. Clearing it returns two and a half times the stake and a supply crate. If the bandits move on first, half the stake is refunded. Hazard risk, planetside.
wg-operation-name-forward-base = Forward Operating Base
wg-operation-desc-forward-base = Seize an outpost held by mercenaries, in space or on a world. Clearing them returns three times the stake and a spoils crate. If the outpost leaves first, a quarter of the stake is refunded. Assault risk.
wg-operation-name-smuggler-rendezvous = Smuggler Rendezvous
wg-operation-desc-smuggler-rendezvous = Take a smugglers' meeting point from the mercenaries guarding it, out in space or at a roadside inn on a world. Clearing them returns three times the stake and a spoils crate. If it leaves first, a quarter of the stake is refunded. Assault risk.
wg-operation-name-probe = Anomalous Probe
wg-operation-desc-probe = A Wizard Federation probe has drifted into the sector, its few crew very dangerous. Clearing them returns three and a half times the stake and a spoils crate. If it leaves first, a quarter of the stake is refunded. Assault risk.
wg-operation-name-garrison = Dug-in Garrison
wg-operation-desc-garrison = A Syndicate garrison has dug into an old vault on one of the sector's worlds. Clearing it returns three and a half times the stake and a spoils crate. If it leaves first, a quarter of the stake is refunded. Assault risk, planetside.
wg-operation-name-black-site = Syndicate Black Site
wg-operation-desc-black-site = Storm a Syndicate intercept station held by a naval garrison, with its armoury still aboard. Clearing it returns three and a half times the stake and a heavy spoils crate. The whole sector learns where it is to the nearest 100 m, and nothing is refunded if it leaves first. High-value risk.
wg-operation-name-blood-moon = Blood Moon Shrine
wg-operation-desc-blood-moon = Purge a blood cult shrine, adrift or raised on a world, and take its relics. Clearing it returns three and a half times the stake and a heavy spoils crate. The whole sector learns where it is to the nearest 100 m, and nothing is refunded if it leaves first. High-value risk.
wg-operation-name-quarantine = Quarantine Breach
wg-operation-desc-quarantine = A quarantined wreck has broken its seals, adrift or crashed on a world, and the Remade aboard are loose, elites among them. Clearing them returns four times the stake and a heavy spoils crate. The whole sector learns where it is to the nearest 100 m, and nothing is refunded if it leaves first. Extreme risk.
